{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game is a demo version of &quot;Doomed Otaku&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a sample where you can experience part of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can currently play up to Day 2. An English translation will be available in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/1.png?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/1.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cThere are real friends in the online world too!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character, Jin Dayeon, is an enthusiastic otaku of the Japanese game <i>Idol\u2606Star</i>, which features idol characters. One day, while playing the game with her friends as usual, she hears that a limited-edition character perfume for <i>Idol\u2606Star</i> will be released exclusively in Japan. In a spur of the moment, she ends up taking charge of organizing a group purchase for the perfume. However, in a fit of impulse, she uses all the collected money for personal purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/3.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 14 days left until the deadline to order the <i>Idol\u2606Star</i> perfume group purchase... Can the protagonist raise 5 million won again in 14 days and place the order?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/2.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether to lead her to ruin or help her reform and become a respectable member of society depends on the player's choices. Enjoy various thrilling endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>~Features~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/5.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a variety of mini-games in both the real and cyber worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/4.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices affect character affinity. Try building relationships with different characters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360610?t=1744530226","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360610?t=1744530226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/c1268c5b790ed37e6c98c0541645abf599330657/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744530226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/c1268c5b790ed37e6c98c0541645abf599330657/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744530226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This game is a demo version of &quot;Doomed Otaku&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a sample where you can experience part of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can currently play up to Day 2. An English translation will be available in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/1.png?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/1.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300cThere are real friends in the online world too!\u300d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character, Jin Dayeon, is an enthusiastic otaku of the Japanese game <i>Idol\u2606Star</i>, which features idol characters. One day, while playing the game with her friends as usual, she hears that a limited-edition character perfume for <i>Idol\u2606Star</i> will be released exclusively in Japan. In a spur of the moment, she ends up taking charge of organizing a group purchase for the perfume. However, in a fit of impulse, she uses all the collected money for personal purposes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/3.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 14 days left until the deadline to order the <i>Idol\u2606Star</i> perfume group purchase... Can the protagonist raise 5 million won again in 14 days and place the order?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/2.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether to lead her to ruin or help her reform and become a respectable member of society depends on the player's choices. Enjoy various thrilling endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>~Features~</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/5.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a variety of mini-games in both the real and cyber worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/extras/4.gif?t=1744530226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices affect character affinity. Try building relationships with different characters.</p>","developers":["KiwiSaurus"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3318210","name":"Doomed Otaku"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360610/67a27feedec2a997c089de836b698602d48f1de7/header.jpg?t=1744530226","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113310,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113310/movie480.mp4?t=1743237642","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113310/movie_max.mp4?t=1743237642"},"name":"Doomed Otaku","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113310/bfbd5ff18f6074c756d3ce2aa25ea36674524d8c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743237642","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113310/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743237642","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113310/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743237642"}}],"name":"Doomed Otaku Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i8 - 7700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> gtx 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux"